# Fault f9_flows_adjusted (writer 6): p2's amount reads flows(pay, m); once v2 adjusts pay and the waiver wv settles
# it, p2 was refused RUN-CYCLE. E §4.1: "Plans read other plans through flows(m[keys], span) ... The instance graph is
# acyclic"; L §5.14.3: "Anything that reads the instance later, through flows, reads the booked amount plus the
# settlements dated in its span"; E §5 step 2: settlements aren't measured. pay[m] is booked on day 20 at cut
# min(t, K): Jan-May at share 1 (100.00 PLN), adjusted by v2 (known 2027-06-15, share 0.9) by -10.00 each, waived by
# wv (no legs, settlement 0). flows(pay, m) for Jan-May is 100 + 0, so p2 = 50.00 each (5 x 50 = 250); Jun-Dec are
# planned at cut K with share 0.9: pay 90.00, p2 45.00 (7 x 45 = 315). Sum: 565.00 PLN.
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2027-06-15
  start 2027-01-01
  end 2027-12-31
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
index month = month 2027-01..2027-12
kind pays: event certain
  leg cash: PLN
kind waivers: event certain
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2027-01-01..
place zus: outside lives 2027-01-01..
input share: num
input base: money PLN
input dom: int
input wd: date
input rate: num
def amt[m in month]: money PLN = round(base * share, minor(PLN), half-up) at start_of(m)
move pay[m in month]: pays
  on day_of(m, dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from konto to zus amount amt[m]
move p2[m in month]: pays
  on day_of(m, dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from konto to zus amount round(flows(pay, m) * rate, minor(PLN), half-up)
move wv[a in adjustments on wd where a.adjusts in pays]: waivers
  on a.day
  fulfils a
source s "x"
version v1
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2027-01-01
  share = 1
  base = 100
  dom = 20
  wd = 2027-06-15
  rate = 0.5
  opening[konto] = 1000 at 2027-01-01 start
version v2
  cite s
  governs 2027..
  known 2027-06-15
  replace share = 0.9
ask q: sum(flows(p2[m], start_of(m)..2027-12-31) for m in month where year_of(m) == 2027) law cut
=== expect
q: 565.00 PLN
...
